the target language is: prolog.

the functions are:
    the initiator id is *a text*.
    the return url is *a text*.
    the initiator allowed of the dv tp service configuration check fr_30_32 is *a truth value*.
    the config ttl days of the dv tp service configuration check fr_30_32 is *a number*.
    the config ttl label of the dv tp service configuration check fr_30_32 is *a text*.
    the initiator id or null is *a text*.
    the return url or null is *a text*.

the templates are:
    the dv tp service configuration check fr_30_32 for *a text* and *a second text* is *a truth value* with *a number* with *a third text* under table dv_tp_service_configuration_check_fr_30_32.

the table dv_tp_service_configuration_check_fr_30_32 is, with first match:
    initiator id         | return url | initiator allowed | config ttl days | config ttl label
    "DEMO-INITIATOR-001" | any        | true              | 365             | "1 jaar"
    "DEMO-INITIATOR-002" | any        | true              | 30              | "30 dagen"
    "DEMO-INITIATOR-003" | any        | false             | 0               | "Niet geregistreerd"
    any                  | any        | true              | 365             | "1 jaar (standaard)"

the knowledge base dvtpconfigcheck includes:

the text of the_model is at "sources/DvtpConfigCheck.dmn".

the initiator id or null is the initiator id, as stated in the model at decision DvTP Service Configuration Check FR-30 32.

rule dv_tp_service_configuration_check_fr_30_32_2 with provenance the model at decision DvTP Service Configuration Check FR-30 32:
the initiator id or null is null if
    it is not the case that the initiator id is a text.

the return url or null is the return url, as stated in the model at decision DvTP Service Configuration Check FR-30 32.

rule dv_tp_service_configuration_check_fr_30_32_4 with provenance the model at decision DvTP Service Configuration Check FR-30 32:
the return url or null is null if
    it is not the case that the return url is a text.

rule dv_tp_service_configuration_check_fr_30_32_5 with provenance the model at decision DvTP Service Configuration Check FR-30 32:
the initiator allowed of the dv tp service configuration check fr_30_32 is a truth value if
    the dv tp service configuration check fr_30_32 for the initiator id or null and the return url or null is the truth value with a number with a text under table dv_tp_service_configuration_check_fr_30_32.

rule dv_tp_service_configuration_check_fr_30_32_6 with provenance the model at decision DvTP Service Configuration Check FR-30 32:
the config ttl days of the dv tp service configuration check fr_30_32 is a number if
    the dv tp service configuration check fr_30_32 for the initiator id or null and the return url or null is a truth value with the number with a text under table dv_tp_service_configuration_check_fr_30_32.

rule dv_tp_service_configuration_check_fr_30_32_7 with provenance the model at decision DvTP Service Configuration Check FR-30 32:
the config ttl label of the dv tp service configuration check fr_30_32 is a text if
    the dv tp service configuration check fr_30_32 for the initiator id or null and the return url or null is a truth value with a number with the text under table dv_tp_service_configuration_check_fr_30_32.

